SkyTekx DE Fixes, an addon for Draconic Evolution 3.1.2.621 (Forge 1.20.1)
==========================================================================

This mod is NOT a modified Draconic Evolution. It is an addon that depends on the
unmodified Draconic Evolution 3.1.2.621, Brandon's Core 3.2.1.302 and CodeChicken Lib
4.4.0.528 jars, which the SkyTekx 3 modpack downloads from Modrinth as they are. It
changes their behaviour at runtime through Mixin and carries no data file of theirs.

